              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau ke egolid ŋikabobooe ŋiarei aŋuna ka Namuroet a ŋin. Toenik ŋikabobooe lowaetin a Namuroet ŋiarei ŋulu eteosi, kwap egolid ŋolo awuat Namuroet anawaetin. Toenikinitetei nakito ŋuna adakitere Namuroet ŋin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.27"
            ]
          }
        },
